    90	VENUE Selecta Mathematica, vol. 30, 2024. Abstract (verbatim, first sentence): "*The two best
    91	studied toric degenerations of the flag variety are those given by the Gelfand–Tsetlin and FFLV
    92	polytopes.*" Preprint arXiv:2112.05894, same title. The paper is about relative poset polytopes,
    93	regular subdivisions, and semitoric degenerations of flag varieties. It contains no multiprojective
    94	Nullstellensatz, and there is no basis for a "Theorem 1.8.1" of that content. The memo's own
    95	reference 31 prints the correct title, so the body's use contradicts its own bibliography.
