**6.8 CONSEQUENCE.**  
Diagonal Hilbert-function vanishing gives a complete hierarchy in the existential sense of step 4.9:

\[
V_{X_0}(I)=\varnothing
\Longrightarrow
\operatorname{HF}_{R/I}(r,\ldots,r)=0
\quad\text{for some finite }r.
